    "the physical layer can already express fibre/coax/DSL/PON upstreams - the media and cages exist",
    "there is no cellular medium at all: 53 of 54 modem ports are declared type 'wireless' and resolve to the Wi-Fi antenna cage",
    "the far end is the problem: generic-cloud has exactly one RJ45 port, so every lab terminates on copper",
    "practically one default route: a second default is stored, never selected, and never fails over"
